+| a method object / an executable / a routine object this crate did not build | class_protocol.rs, object_protocol.rs, executable.rs | Task 7 (guards on `executable_sources`, scout-leaks L9 group) |
+| a stack frame this crate did not build | context.rs, object_protocol.rs | Task 8, note: StackFrame body-shape guard |
+| an object this crate did not build | construct.rs | Task 8, note: body-shape guard in the subclass setup |
+| a value whose object is no longer live | construct.rs, object_protocol.rs, dispatch.rs, environment.rs | Task 8, note: freed-handle guard |
